 "rarityFrom": "Exophase (PlayStation players)",
 "notes": [
  "For the God of War III PC recompilation (gow3_pc). Story trophies come from your saves, which list every level you've been through; Vault only reads them. Trophies the recomp reports in its log (last_run.log) count too.",
  "Vault finds the gow3-windows folder on your drives by itself. If it doesn't show up, click Add a game and pick God of War III.exe in that folder.",
  "The recomp starts a fresh log every launch, so keep Vault running while you play. King of the Hill unlocks once you have every other trophy, like the platinum on PlayStation.",
  "So far Kill Poseidon and Beat the game are read from saves; more story trophies are added as their levels are mapped. Counters (like the 1000-hit combo) wait until the recomp reports trophies."
 ],
 "testGuide": [
  {
   "title": "Kill Poseidon",
   "detail": "Kill Poseidon and let the game autosave in Hades. \"Releasing the Floodgates\" should pop up within a few seconds of the save."
  }
